CommitDate: Mon Jun 9 12:51:25 2025 +1200

    Bug 1971060 - Make an interface that VirtualFolderWrapper implements. r=BenC
    By creating this interface and making everything¹ use it, we can (in the next patch) add another
    implementation that works differently.

    ¹ Almost everything. I didn't make it handle the smart mailboxes (as the new implementation won't
    be dealing with them) or the code that handles changes to the folder hierarchy (as the new
    implementation will be doing that separately, and it's too messy to update here).

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D253265

